116
00:07:32,880 --> 00:07:37,280
So this phrase might as well is, it's kind of hard to understand I think sometimes.

117
00:07:37,840 --> 00:07:43,940
Basically what the speaker is saying is that while he is doing this, he can also do something else.

118
00:07:44,820 --> 00:07:44,960
Okay.

119
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:46,220
So he's here.

120
